.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Per-project data (Blueprint IDs, blendshapes, versions) lives in the
# user's Unity project under ProjectSettings/ShiroOutfit_*.json — never in
# this repo. EditorPrefs only holds global defaults (templates, sound toggle).
